{"$schema":"https://json.schemastore.org/sarif-2.1.0.json","runs":[{"artifacts":[{"contents":{"text":"<scxml xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2005/07/scxml\" version=\"1.0\" initial=\"work\">\n  <state id=\"work\" initial=\"p\">\n    <parallel id=\"p\"/>\n    <transition event=\"go\" target=\"done\"/>\n  </state>\n  <final id=\"done\"/>\n</scxml>\n"},"location":{"uri":"tests/ui/lint021-regionless-parallel.scx"},"mimeType":"application/scxml+xml"}],"columnKind":"utf16CodeUnits","properties":{"diagnosticCounts":{"errors":0,"notes":0,"total":1,"warnings":1},"producer":{"kind":"validator"}},"results":[{"fixes":[{"artifactChanges":[{"artifactLocation":{"uri":"tests/ui/lint021-regionless-parallel.scx"},"replacements":[{"deletedRegion":{"byteLength":8,"byteOffset":114,"endColumn":14,"endLine":3,"startColumn":6,"startLine":3},"insertedContent":{"text":"state"}}]}],"description":{"text":"change `<parallel>` to `<state>`"},"properties":{"applicability":"maybe-incorrect"}}],"level":"warning","locations":[{"physicalLocation":{"artifactLocation":{"uri":"tests/ui/lint021-regionless-parallel.scx"},"region":{"endColumn":14,"endLine":3,"startColumn":6,"startLine":3}}}],"message":{"markdown":"`<parallel>` has no child states\n\n**Note:** SCXML 1.0 §3.4.2 allows a `<parallel>` with no `<state>` children, but only atomic states enable transitions (§3.13: \"enabled by named event E in atomic state S\"), and a `<parallel>` is never atomic (§3.3: \"An atomic state is a <state> that has no <state>, <parallel> or <final> children\"); while it is active, its own transitions are never taken, its ancestors' only through other active atomic states, and it never raises `done.state`\n\n**Help:** give the `<parallel>` its regions as child `<state>` elements, or make it an atomic `<state>`\n\n**Spec:** SCXML 1.0 §3.4 <parallel>","text":"`<parallel>` has no child states"},"properties":{"byteSpan":{"end":122,"start":114},"category":"lint"},"ruleId":"LINT021"}],"tool":{"driver":{"informationUri":"https://www.w3.org/TR/scxml/","name":"scxml-validator","rules":[{"defaultConfiguration":{"level":"warning"},"fullDescription":{"text":"SCXML 1.0 §3.4.2 allows a `<parallel>` with no regions (its `<state>` children occur \"0 or more times\"), but §3.13 enables a transition only \"in atomic state S\" and §3.3 defines an atomic state as \"a <state> that has no <state>, <parallel> or <final> children\", so a `<parallel>` is never atomic: while a regionless one is active, none of its own transitions is taken, its ancestors' transitions are taken only through other active atomic states, and no `done.state` event is raised for it"},"help":{"text":"How to fix: give the `<parallel>` its regions as child `<state>` elements, or make it an atomic `<state>`.\n\nSpecification: SCXML 1.0 §3.4 <parallel>\n\nRun `scx --explain LINT021` for examples."},"helpUri":"https://www.w3.org/TR/scxml/#parallel","id":"LINT021","name":"LINT021","properties":{"category":"lint"},"shortDescription":{"text":"a `<parallel>` has no child states, so no transition is enabled through it"}}],"semanticVersion":"0.2.0"}}}],"version":"2.1.0"}